# Keeps `docker compose build` fast, especially when the Docker daemon is remote (e.g.
# `docker context` over SSH to a real Linux host - see README.md): the whole build context
# gets tar'd up and sent to the daemon on every build, and only tools/aeron_bench/,
# lib/aeron-driver.sh and docker/aeron-bench/entrypoint.sh are actually needed by
# docker/aeron-bench/Dockerfile (all COPY'd via explicit paths, unaffected by this file).
#
# NOTE: lib/ is deliberately NOT excluded. lib/aeron-driver.sh is shared between the image
# and the native (no-Docker) execution path, and the image COPYs it - which is exactly why it
# sits at the top level instead of under the excluded scripts/.
results/
scripts/
*.md
